; root cluster for all music/sangeetham domain nodes.
; sangeetham is grounded in physics (spanda, taranga) and math (frequency ratios).
; shruti intervals are frequency ratios — pure mathematics expressed as sound.
; naada-brahma: sound IS the fundamental vibration of existence.
; domain identity
; sangati roots

(kosha sangeetham-varga
  (sthita domain-sangeetham)
  (vishesa physics-varga math-varga)
  (swarupa subanta)
  (yukta spanda taranga naada kaala matra))
